            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Chay Nam Thien Dang",
            "review_text": "Kokokawa\nAtlanta, Georgia97 contributions\n0\nBest Vegan food in HCM and best Vegan Hamburgers :)\nSep 2016 • Family\nI took my family to eat here while they were visiting from the US. The food was 100% delicious and the price was incredible cheap for everything we got. We ended up getting so many dishes so many people could eat different things like : Korean rice with Kim chi, Chinese rice, French rice, tofu and mushrooms, fried spring rolls, Vietnamese noodles. They also had fresh juice and also carried a brand called JuicElixir which is an organic, cold-pressed juice shop in Saigon. I could eat here everyday. It was less than $5 per person... Unbelievable for all of the delicious dishes we ordered.\n\nWe will definitely be back! Thanks to all the staff that accommodated is and put us upstairs in their more private room. The staff was incredibly friendly and also very fun to be around. See you all soon!\nRead more\nWritten September 15, 2016",
